sequenceDiagram
    participant PS as Publishing skill
    participant I as Idiolect
    PS->>I: rewrite draft interactive=false report=true channel=newsletter
    I->>I: resolve slot, rewrite, check
    alt pass or low_confidence
        I-->>PS: text + report (status pass)
        PS->>PS: publish
    else fail, no_slot, no_store, needs_input, error
        I-->>PS: report with status and reason
        PS->>PS: stop and tell the writer
    end
